@setup aeat config profile edit docs-sequence-sandbox --quiet --accept-defaults --activity-start-date 2026-01-01
@step Open the latest annual Modelo 390 summary backed by a filing-grade registry revision.
@result aeat --format json app modelo work create --modelo 390 --year 2025 --period 0A
@expect result.name == "390-2025-0A"
@expect result.revision_id == "2025"
@expect exit_code == 0
@step Calculate, verify, export, and file the annual summary.
@static aeat app modelo work calculate --modelo 390 --year 2025 --period 0A
@blocked unconverted Refuses REFUSED_MODELO_CROSS_PERIOD_CLEAN_STATE, missing_303_periods 1T, 2T, 3T, 4T; the annual fold-in needs all four quarters filed and this sequence files none.
@static aeat app modelo work verify --modelo 390 --year 2025 --period 0A
@blocked unconverted Cascades from the calculate frame above: with no calculation revision the work unit has no selectable current_calculation_revision_id to verify.
@static aeat app modelo export --modelo 390 --year 2025 --period 0A --output ./modelo-390-2025.boe
@blocked unconverted Cascades from the calculate frame above: no exportable verified or filed revision exists until the four-quarter fold-in produces one.
@static aeat app modelo work file --modelo 390 --year 2025 --period 0A
@blocked unconverted Cascades from the calculate frame above: with no calculation revision the work unit has no selectable current_calculation_revision_id to file.
@static aeat app modelo reconcile pull --modelo 390 --year 2025 --period 0A
@blocked live-aeat The pull verb fetches from the AEAT sede; the sandbox refuses live frames.
